    "font size" : 7.492,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "On December 31, 2020, the aggregate transaction price allocated to unsatisfied (or partially unsatisfied) performance obligations related to contracts having an original expected duration in excess of one year was approximately $541 million. We estimate recognition of approximately $412 million of this amount as revenue in 2021 and an additional $129 million in 2022 and thereafter."
